  "ingredients": [
    "4 egg whites",
    "0.25 teaspoon cream of tartar",
    "1 cup white sugar",
    "4 egg yolks",
    "0.5 cup white sugar",
    "2 teaspoons lemon zest",
    "0.33333334326744 cup lemon juice",
    "1.125 cups heavy cream",
    "1 teaspoon lemon zest"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 250 degrees F ( 120 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat egg whites until stiff in a clean mixing bowl. Add cream of tartar; gradually add 1 cup sugar, beating until glossy.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/iORgl04mC2ofkvJWlgp3p0TwRso=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/12078-angel-pie-VAT-step-02-702ad696733d43df8f48fcc8b15b01ea.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12078/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer meringue into a well-greased 10-inch pie plate. Spread over bottom and sides of the plate, building up sides 1/2 inch above the edge of the plate.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/xAn5F_XBxl__PnWrhiAXuNIEJx4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/12078-angel-pie-VAT-step-03-0096c67f5ea1449bb7678aa141b7b95f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12078/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven for 1 1/2 hours. Turn off the oven; leave meringue inside to cool slowly.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Cyxe6lIle7BxIpn10opVh9S2G90=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/12078-angel-pie-VAT-step-04-68feeeeecc3c47f2b1472a05ea78173e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12078/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine egg yolks, 1/2 cup sugar, 2 teaspoons zest, and lemon juice in a double boiler. Cook, stirring constantly, over medium-low heat until thick.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/nGp9z2FfucGeiwzINqrTMoAw4c8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/12078-angel-pie-VAT-step-05-e680b33c0f8843759ee0c099441d4cb7.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12078/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour into a bowl and cool thoroughly.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/AXEWA2ctrUI-eFHj2pr0xLQyNKQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/12078-angel-pie-VAT-step-06-3728b65932474a448afc9a10737edceb.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12078/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whip cold heavy cream in a mixing bowl until stiff. Place 1/2 of the whipped cream in cooled meringue shell. Cover with a layer of lemon filling and top with remaining whipped cream. (This top layer can be piped with a decorative star tip). Garnish with remaining lemon zest. Refrigerate until serving.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Rb5K17PKXKcGmM4yTlAI1wv8Q6E=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/12078-angel-pie-VAT-step-07-c2392c91fea84e2bbfd8c4adbe8ff204.jpg"
      ],
